# =========================================================================
# orch_model_selection.tcyr — a task's model, from the agent to the wire (ADR 030).
#
# `llm_model_catalog.tcyr` pins what the catalog says. This pins what a crew does with it: which id
# reaches the gateway, whose name goes on the result, a crew that has no model to send, and a
# selection the gateway refuses. No oracle tests: the Rust line sent names it carried.
#
# Each test has a gateway of its own, as a catalog is held for the life of the process.
# =========================================================================

# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.

